{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And known among the nations.</b> This verse does not imply that Israel will again be scattered, but rather they will be known among the nations who come to observe the festival of Sukkot, as written in the book of Zechariah <small>(Zechariah 14:16)</small>, and those who pay tribute:"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 61, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:00:35.203119035Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}